{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"solidity","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"Solidity","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Solidity (.sol).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"solidity","name":"Solidity","extensions":[".sol"],"grammar":"grammars/solidity.json","lineComment":"//","blockComment":["/*","*/"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"Solidity","path":"snippets/solidity.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/solidity.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\/\\\\*\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\*\\\\/\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\/\\\\/.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:constructor|anonymous|immutable|interface|unchecked|abstract|assembly|calldata|constant|continue|contract|external|fallback|function|internal|modifier|override|address|indexed|library|mapping|payable|private|receive|returns|require|storage|virtual|delete|import|memory|pragma|public|return|revert|assert|struct|break|catch|error|event|using|while|else|emit|enum|pure|type|view|for|new|try|as|do|if|is)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:seconds|minutes|false|ether|hours|weeks|super|block|true|gwei|days|this|wei|msg|tx)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:bytes32|uint128|uint256|address|string|uint16|uint32|uint64|int256|bytes|uint8|bool|uint|int)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_]*\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/solidity.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Contract\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"contract\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\",\n      \"pragma solidity ^${1:0.8.24};\",\n      \"\",\n      \"contract ${2:Name} {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A contract\"\n  },\n  \"Function\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fn\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"function ${1:name}(${2:uint256 value}) public ${3:view} returns (${4:uint256}) {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A function\"\n  },\n  \"Event\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"event\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"event ${1:Name}(${2:address indexed from}, ${3:uint256 value});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An event\"\n  },\n  \"Modifier\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"mod\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"modifier ${1:onlyOwner}() {\",\n      \"\\trequire(${2:msg.sender == owner}, \\\"${3:Not allowed}\\\");\",\n      \"\\t_;\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A modifier\"\n  },\n  \"Mapping\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"map\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"mapping(${1:address} => ${2:uint256}) public ${3:balances};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A mapping\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Solidity\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Solidity.\n\n## Files\n\n`.sol`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `//`.\n- 5 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `contract` | A contract |\n| `fn` | A function |\n| `event` | An event |\n| `mod` | A modifier |\n| `map` | A mapping |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}